  "keyFeatures": [
    "Multi-agent AI banking (Intelligent Engine B1) for fraud detection, compliance, payments, and support",
    "Buburuza-Chain: Arbitrum Orbit Layer 3 blockchain with 40,000+ TPS and sub-$0.001 fees",
    "$BUB token with deflationary tokenomics and DAO governance",
    "USDB and EURB stablecoins with 1:1 USDC/EURC backing",
    "KYC/AML compliance via Sumsub with 85% approval in 30 seconds",
    "Banking-as-a-Service APIs and SDKs for JavaScript, Python, Java, iOS, Android",
    "Real-world asset (RWA) tokenization via Buburuza-Labs",
    "Multi-jurisdiction regulatory coverage (FINTRAC, Comoros Banking License)",
    "Institutional custody via Fireblocks integration",
    "AI-powered credit scoring, fraud detection, and natural language banking"
  ],
